@prefix lzo: <https://w3id.org/lzo/ontology/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .
@prefix ssn: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
skos:Concept a owl:Class .
prov:Entity a owl:Class .
prov:Agent a owl:Class .
sosa:Sensor a owl:Class .
sosa:Actuator a owl:Class .
ssn:System a owl:Class .
lzo:AgriculturalEntity a owl:Class .
lzo:Organization a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Agent .
lzo:Source a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
lzo:Evidence a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
lzo:Assertion a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
lzo:managedBy a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:range lzo:Organization .
lzo:partOf a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:TransitiveProperty; rdfs:domain lzo:AgriculturalEntity; rdfs:range lzo:AgriculturalEntity .
